# src/apps/android/app/src/test/java/com/luminet/android

## Purpose
Holds LumiNet Android local unit tests for application logic that can execute on the host JVM.

## Contents
Contains test classes and nested feature-specific packages, including DNS and tunnel behavior coverage.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Exercises Android application contracts through JVM-compatible code, mocks, and test fixtures configured by Gradle.

## Invariants
Tests must be deterministic without a real device, avoid leaking shared state between cases, and remain aligned with the production contracts they characterize.